<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-04 Workflow: 11 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Thêm ◉ activity final “File version signed with its hash”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm text “File version signed with its hash”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign file version → Sign the result-file version?&lt;br&gt;• Đổi hình: activity activity “Sign file version” → decision&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Notify tester”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Approve result” → activity “Sign file version” → activity “Approve result” → system activity “Close testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn:  → sign&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign file version” → system activity “Close testing task” → decision “Sign the result-file version?” → ◉ activity final “File version signed with its hash” [sign]&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “New current version” → decision “Sign the result-file version?”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm decision “Sign the result-file version?” → notification “✉ Notify tester” [reject with reason]&lt;br&gt;• Thêm notification “✉ Notify tester” → activity “Save result file”" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="2420" height="328" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="356" width="1170" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_r" value="Sau" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="356" width="1170" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_wf04_lane_t